== Usage ==

Place this infobox at the start of a status effect page for a buff or debuff
affecting a character or monster. All fields are optional, and blank fields
hide their rows. It matches [[Template:Action]], [[Template:Item]], and
[[Template:Mob]].

<pre>
{{Status Effect
| icon =
| type =
| duration =
| actions =
| items =
}}
</pre>

<code>icon</code> is the effect's client icon ID. It selects the uploaded image
<code>File:XIVL_&lt;id&gt;.png</code>. Status icons are small, so they display at
40px rather than the 64px used for action icons.

<code>type</code> is Beneficial or Detrimental. Follow the game's wording: an
effect it <em>grants</em> is beneficial, while one it <em>inflicts</em> is
detrimental.

Include the unit in <code>duration</code>, such as "30 seconds" or "10 minutes".
Leave it blank for an effect that lasts until removed.

<code>actions</code> and <code>items</code> list what applies the effect. The
client tables do not record these relationships. Use the 1.x reference when
it identifies a source; otherwise leave the fields blank.

== Page titles ==

Name every status effect page <code>&lt;name&gt; (Status Effect)</code>, even
when no other page shares its name. Use the same title in links.
